<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-E.P. 86-1 AT LUNCH - NEED 94 MORE TO WIN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-E.P. 86-1 AT LUNCH - NEED 94 MORE TO WIN.</headline>
<dateline>PAARL 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eastern Province were 86 for one wicket at lunch on the fourth day of their Supersport Series match against Boland at Boland Park on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The victory target is 180.</p>
<p>Boland 204 and 237</p>
<p>Eastern Province 262 and 86-1</p>
